text Route32_Text_RoadblockMan_WhatsTheHurry {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Espera!\n¿Por qué corres?"
        _: "Wait up!\nWhat's the hurry?"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_RoadblockMan_ExperiencesShouldBeUseful {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "Tu experiencia en CIUDAD MALVA\ndebería ayudarte en tu viaje."
        _: "Your experiences in VIOLET CITY\nshould be useful for your journey."
    }
}

text Route32_Text_RoadblockMan_VioletGym {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¿Has ido al GIMNASIO {POKEMON}?\nAllí puedes probar a tus {POKEMON} y\la ti mismo.\p¡Es un rito para todos los\nentrenadores!"
        _: "Have you gone to the {POKEMON}\nGYM in VIOLET yet?\pYou can test your {POKEMON} and\nyourself there.\pIt's a rite of passage for all\nTRAINERS!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_RoadblockMan_HaveThisSeed {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "Tienes {POKEMON} muy buenos.\pSeguro que es por haberlos entrenado\nen los alrededores de CIUDAD MALVA.\pEl entrenamiento en el GIMNASIO ha\ndebido de ser de gran ayuda.\pToma esto como recuerdo de\nCIUDAD MALVA.\pAumenta el poder de los movimientos\nde tipo PLANTA."
        _: "Looks like you have some good\n{POKEMON} there.\pIt must be from the training you\ngave them around VIOLET CITY.\pThe training at the GYM must have\nbeen especially helpful.\pAs a souvenir of VIOLET CITY,\ntake this.\pIt increases the power of GRASS-\ntype moves."
    }
}

text Route32_Text_RoadblockMan_AideIsWaiting {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "{PLAYER}, ¿verdad?\nUn tipo con gafas te buscaba.\pCompruébalo. Te está esperando en\nel CENTRO {POKEMON}."
        _: "{PLAYER}, right?\nSome guy wearing glasses was\llooking for you.\pGo see for yourself. He's waiting\nfor you at the {POKEMON} CENTER."
    }
}

text Route32_Text_SlowpokeTailMan_HeyKid {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Eh, chico!\n¡Espera un momento!"
        _: "Hey, kid!\nHold on a sec!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_SlowpokeTailMan_MillionDollarSlowpokeTail {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¿Te gustaría tener esta sabrosa y\nnutritiva COLASLOWPOKE?\p¡Sólo te costará 1.000.000¥!\p¡Te gustará!"
        _: "How would you like to have this\ntasty, nutritious SLOWPOKETAIL?\pFor you right now, it costs just\n¥1,000,000!\pYou'll want this!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_SlowpokeTailMan_ThoughtKidsWereLoaded {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Vaya! Pensaba que los niños de hoy\nen día estaban forrados…"
        _: "Tch! And here I thought kids these\ndays were loaded…"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_SlowpokeTailMan_RefusedToBuySlowpokeTail {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¿No la quieres? Pues lárgate."
        _: "You don't want it? You're sure?\nThen scram. Shoo!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_RoarTMGuy_Intro {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡GRRRRRR!\p¡TODOS HUYEN CUANDO RUJO!\n¡PERO TÚ HAS VENIDO!\p¡ESO ME GUSTA!\n¡TOMA ESTO!"
        _: "WROOOOAR!\pPEOPLE RUN WHEN I ROAR!\nBUT YOU CAME LOOKING!\pTHAT PLEASES ME!\nNOW TAKE THIS!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_RoarTMGuy_Outro {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡GRRRRRR!\n¡ES RUGIDO!\pHASTA LOS {POKEMON} HUYEN CON UN RUGIDO."
        _: "WROOOAR!\nIT'S ROAR!\pEVEN {POKEMON} WILL RUN FROM A\nGOOD ROAR!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Frieda_GivesGift {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Toma una FLECHA VENENOSA!"
        _: "Here's a POISON BARB for you!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Frieda_Meet {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "VICKI: ¡Yuju!\n¡Es viernes!\pSoy VICKI, por viernes.\n¡Mucho gusto!\p{STR_VAR_1}"
        _: "FRIEDA: Yahoo!\nIt's FRIDAY!\pI'm FRIEDA of FRIDAY!\nNice to meet you!\p{STR_VAR_1}"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Frieda_RetryGift {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "VICKI: {STR_VAR_1}"
        _: "FRIEDA: {STR_VAR_1}"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Frieda_GaveGift {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "VICKI: Dásela a un {POKEMON}\nde tipo VENENO.\p¡Oh!\n¡Es brutal!\p¡Te sorprenderá ver cómo mejoran\nlos movimientos de tipo VENENO!"
        _: "FRIEDA: Give it to a {POKEMON} that\nhas POISON-type moves.\pOh!\nIt's wicked!\pYou'll be shocked how good it makes\nPOISON-type moves!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Frieda_NotFriday {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "VICKI: ¿Hoy no es viernes?\n¡Me aburro cuando no lo es!"
        _: "FRIEDA: Isn't it FRIDAY today?\nIt's so boring when it's not!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Frieda_Friday {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "VICKI: ¡Hola!\n¿Qué día prefieres?\pA mí me gusta el viernes,\nsin duda.\p¿No crees que es genial?"
        _: "FRIEDA: Hiya!\nWhat day do you like?\pI love FRIDAY.\nThere's no doubt about it!\pDon't you think it's great too?"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Albert_Seen {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "No te había visto antes.\n¿Te crees muy fuerte?"
        _: "I haven't seen you around before.\nSo you think you're pretty tough?"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Albert_Lost {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Eres fuerte!"
        _: "You're stronger than you look!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Albert_AfterBeaten {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "Intentaré ser el mejor con mis\nfavoritos.\pNo uso los mismos {POKEMON} que\ntodo el mundo."
        _: "I'm going to try to be the best\nwith my favorites.\pI'm not using the same tough\n{POKEMON} as everyone else."
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Liz_Seen {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "Sí.\nY sabes que…\p¿Luchar? ¡Estoy al teléfono!\pVale.\nPero que sea rápido."
        _: "Uh-huh.\nYeah, and you know…\pPardon? You want to battle?\nI'm on the phone.\pOh, all right.\nBut let's make this fast."
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Liz_Lost {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Oh! ¡Tengo que aliviar mi enfado!"
        _: "Oh!\nI've got to relieve my anger!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Liz_Rematch {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Llegas tarde!\n¡Comencemos!"
        _: "You're late!\nLet's get started now!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Liz_AskForNumberEnd {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "¡Estemos en contacto!\n¿Me das tu número de teléfono?\p¡Quiero enterarme de todo lo que\nvas viendo!"
        _: "phone number?\pI want to hear about everything\nyou've seen!"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Liz_AskNumber {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "Yo también estaba charlando.\p¿Eh? ¿Estás recorriéndote todo\nel mundo?\p{STR_VAR_1}"
        _: "I was having a nice chat, too.\pOh? You're on a big journey to see\nthe sights?\pNeat! Let's be friends!\nCan I have your {STR_VAR_1}"
    }
}

text Route32_Text_Trainer_Liz_AskNumberAgain {
    poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
        SPANISH: "{STR_VAR_1}"
        _: "Let's be friends! Can I have your\n{STR_VAR_1}"
